.TH POLYMORPH 1 "" "polymorph 0.0.1.dev1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
polymorph \- write hook configs for other coding harnesses from a repository's Claude Code config
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
polymorph manage generate [\-\-repo REPO] [\-\-harness HARNESS ...] [\-\-check] [\-\-mappings MAPPINGS] [\-\-trust\-dir TRUST_DIR ...]
.br
polymorph manage check [\-\-repo REPO] [\-\-harness HARNESS ...] [\-\-format {text,json,sarif}] [\-\-strict]
.br
polymorph manage validate file
.br
polymorph manage conformance [\-\-harness HARNESS]
.br
polymorph manage adopt [\-\-repo REPO] [\-\-dry\-run] [\-\-no\-links]
.br
polymorph equip [\-\-repo REPO] \-\-harness HARNESS [\-\-dry\-run] [\-\-no\-links] [\-\-gitignore]
.br
polymorph adapter \-\-harness HARNESS [\-\-mappings MAPPINGS] [\-\-trust\-dir TRUST_DIR ...] [\-\-repo REPO] [\-\-timeout TIMEOUT] [\-\-fail\-open] script...
.br
polymorph inventory [\-\-repo REPO] [\-\-harness NAME ...] [\-\-json]
.br
polymorph env [\-\-repo REPO] [\-\-harness NAME] [\-\-exec CMD]
.br
polymorph capture [\-\-harness HARNESS] [\-\-yes] [\-\-keep] [\-\-steps STEP] [\-\-step\-timeout SECONDS] [\-\-total\-timeout SECONDS] [\-\-out DIR] [\-\-print\-prompts] [\-\-full] [\-\-i\-really\-want\-this\-in\-the\-repo\-raw]
.br
polymorph discover init \-\-harness HARNESS \-\-config\-path CONFIG_PATH [\-\-event\-name EVENT_NAME] [\-\-matcher MATCHER] [\-\-shape {claude\-settings,claude\-like}] [\-\-log\-dir LOG_DIR] [\-\-env\-be\-very\-careful] [\-\-full] [\-\-i\-really\-want\-this\-in\-the\-repo\-raw]
.br
polymorph discover log \-\-out OUT [\-\-env\-be\-very\-careful] [\-\-full] [\-\-plugin\-version V] [\-\-location LOC]
.br
polymorph discover reload\-check \-\-config\-path CONFIG_PATH \-\-scratch\-log SCRATCH_LOG [\-\-finish] [\-\-event\-name EVENT_NAME] [\-\-matcher MATCHER] [\-\-shape {claude\-settings,claude\-like}]
.br
polymorph discover summary [\-\-include EVENT ...] [\-\-event EVENT ...] file
.br
polymorph discover draft \-\-name NAME [\-\-include EVENT ...] [\-\-event EVENT ...] file
.br
polymorph discover probe \-\-harness HARNESS [\-\-into DRAFT.toml] [\-\-yes] [\-\-keep] [\-\-full] [\-\-step\-timeout SECONDS] [\-\-total\-timeout SECONDS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
polymorph reads a repository's Claude Code agent config (.agents/settings.json and .agents/hooks/) and writes hook configs for other coding harnesses from declarative per\-harness TOML mappings. It also reports what else the repository provides (skills, rules, memory files) that a harness will not read, and can run a hook script behind a mapping at hook time.
.PP
.B polymorph is experimental and unvetted. It sits on a safety path (guard hooks), where a wrong mapping can fail open. Nothing here promises compatibility.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS polymorph manage
Maintainer half: keep the basecamp and generate harness configs.
.PP
.nf
polymorph manage COMMAND
.fi
.SS polymorph manage generate
Write harness configs from .agents/settings.json.
.PP
.nf
polymorph manage generate [\-\-repo REPO] [\-\-harness HARNESS ...] [\-\-check] [\-\-mappings MAPPINGS] [\-\-trust\-dir TRUST_DIR ...]
.fi
.TP
.B \-\-repo REPO
repository root (default .)
.TP
.B \-\-harness HARNESS
harness to generate for; repeatable (default: those enabled in .polymorph/basecamp/config.toml)
.TP
.B \-\-check
exit 1 on drift, write nothing
.TP
.B \-\-mappings MAPPINGS
directory of mappings to load; must be trusted (see \-\-trust\-dir)
.TP
.B \-\-trust\-dir TRUST_DIR
additional directory mappings may be loaded from; repeatable
.SS polymorph manage check
