.SS polymorph adapter
Run a hook script through a harness adapter.
.PP
.nf
polymorph adapter \-\-harness HARNESS [\-\-mappings MAPPINGS] [\-\-trust\-dir TRUST_DIR ...] [\-\-repo REPO] [\-\-timeout TIMEOUT] [\-\-fail\-open] script...
.fi
.TP
.B script
after `\-\-`: hook script (and args)
.TP
.B \-\-harness HARNESS
harness whose mapping translates the payload
.TP
.B \-\-mappings MAPPINGS
directory of mappings to load; must be trusted (see \-\-trust\-dir)
.TP
.B \-\-trust\-dir TRUST_DIR
additional directory mappings may be loaded from; repeatable
.TP
.B \-\-repo REPO
repository root (default: the nearest directory above the working directory with .agents/)
.TP
.B \-\-timeout TIMEOUT
seconds before the hook is killed (default 60); a killed hook is NOT checked, never a deny
.TP
.B \-\-fail\-open
on an adapter or hook fault, let the call run with a NOT\-checked message (default: block it)
