.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Findings or drift (manage check, manage generate \-\-check), a refusal (manage adopt), a failed manage conformance run.
.TP
.B 2
A usage error or an error in the input. The adapter never exits 2: its faults are reported as NOT checked.
.TP
.B 3
manage generate has undecided items and wrote nothing for those targets.
